  <MUGB_SlaveMarriageProclamation.label>노예결혼</MUGB_SlaveMarriageProclamation.label>
  <MUGB_SlaveMarriageProclamation.logRulesInitiator.rulesStrings.0>r_logentry-&gt;[INITIATOR_nameDef]가 [RECIPIENT_nameDef]에게 자신의 밤시중을 들라고 강요함.</MUGB_SlaveMarriageProclamation.logRulesInitiator.rulesStrings.0>
  <MUGB_SlaveMarriageProclamation.logRulesInitiator.rulesStrings.1>r_logentry-&gt;[INITIATOR_nameDef]가 [RECIPIENT_nameDef]에게 자신의 첩이 될 것을 강요함.</MUGB_SlaveMarriageProclamation.logRulesInitiator.rulesStrings.1>
  <MUGB_SlaveMarriageProclamation.logRulesInitiator.rulesStrings.2>r_logentry-&gt;[INITIATOR_nameDef]가 [RECIPIENT_nameDef]에게 '특별한' 대우를 약속함.</MUGB_SlaveMarriageProclamation.logRulesInitiator.rulesStrings.2>
  <MUGB_SlaveMarriageProclamation.logRulesInitiator.rulesStrings.3>r_logentry-&gt;[INITIATOR_nameDef]가 [RECIPIENT_nameDef]에게 회개할 수 있는 특별한 방법을 설명함.</MUGB_SlaveMarriageProclamation.logRulesInitiator.rulesStrings.3>
  <MUGB_SlaveMarriageProclamation.logRulesInitiator.rulesStrings.4>r_logentry-&gt;[INITIATOR_nameDef]은 [RECIPIENT_nameDef]가 죽인 정착민만큼 정착민을 낳아야 한다고 큰소리로 고함침.</MUGB_SlaveMarriageProclamation.logRulesInitiator.rulesStrings.4>
